### What happened?

Auto generated code based on the swagger spec ` is missing the fields `x-kubernetes-patch-merge-key` and  `x-kubernetes-patch-strategy` for `io.k8s.apiextensions-apiserver.pkg.apis.apiextensions.v1.JSONSchemaProps`.

A CRD generated with and validated against the schema will not be able to set these properties.

### What did you expect to happen?

The generated code should include the fields on `JSONSchemaProps`.

### How can we reproduce it (as minimally and precisely as possible)?

The spec for `io.k8s.apiextensions-apiserver.pkg.apis.apiextensions.v1.JSONSchemaProps` should include `x-kubernetes-patch-merge-key` and  `x-kubernetes-patch-strategy`

Spec here: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/master/api/openapi-spec/swagger.json)

